Uploader:     granata mail caribusiness it (Paolo D\\'Urso)
Type:         dev/asm
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This's the Asm source of an old Aga intro by X-ZoNe! To run it, just change
the incdir at the beginning and then jump with AsmOne or AsmPro. A long time
passed since I released this intro, so if you find some bugs don't stress me.
For newer thigs from me, get Darkage productions from Aminet.
